{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"6015003040010","name":"甜花","text":"…………\r\n……敗者、復活……","trans":"…………\n……败者，复活……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"甜花、どうした……？","trans":"甜花，怎么了……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015003040020","name":"甜花","text":"……甜花……\r\n一回、ダメだった……","trans":"……我……\n失败过一次了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015003040030","name":"甜花","text":"オーディション、ダメで……お仕事も、ダメで……\r\n……なんもできないって、思った……","trans":"试镜不行……工作也不行……\n……我觉得自己什么都做不到……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015003040040","name":"甜花","text":"……でも……\r\nチャンス……まだ、あった……","trans":"……不过……\n机会……还有……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015003040050","name":"甜花","text":"まだ……\r\nゲームオーバーじゃ……ない……！","trans":"还没……\n还没有游戏结束……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-7","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──ああ！\r\nここからだって、クリアできるんだ！","trans":"──是啊！\n就算从这儿开始，也能通关的！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015003040060","name":"甜花","text":"…………！\r\n甜花……チャレンジ、してくる……！","trans":"…………！\n我……去挑战试试……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}